# "Each end step" includes Bot2's. Bot2 plays Soul-Guide Lantern on its turn, exiling Faithless Looting from Bot1's
# graveyard, so a card left Bot1's graveyard in Bot2's turn and Gau (still a 2/2, it never attacked) deals 2 to Bot2
# at the beginning of Bot2's end step.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Gau, Feral Youth
Faithless Looting
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Soul-Guide Lantern
Island x18

