Bot1.Hand.Gau, Feral Youth.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Soul-Guide Lantern.Cast
Bot2.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Faithless Looting)
